      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasesithi: Le izakuba yindlu yeNkosi uNkulunkulu, laleli libe lialtare lomnikelo wokutshiswa kaIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida waselaya ukuba kubuthaniswe abezizweni ababekhona koIsrayeli; wakhetha abanye babo ukuba babaze amatshe okwakha indlu kaNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wadinga insimbi enengi kakhulu yokwenza izipikili zezivalo lensimbi zokuhlanganisa, wadinga lethusi elinengi elingelakulinganiswa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lezigodo zemikusu ezingelakubalwa; abaseSidoni labaseTire bamlethela imikusu eminengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wathi: USolomoni indodana yami usengumfana, kakabi lakwazi, indlu ezakwakhelwa iNkosi uNkulunkulu kumele ibe nkulu, ibatshazwe ibe lodumo emazweni wonke. Ngakhoke mina ngizakwenza amalungiselelo ngayo. Ngakho uDavida wasedingake impahla ezinengi zokwakha engakafi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebiza uSolomoni indodana yakhe, wamlaya ukuba akhele iNkosi uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli indlu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kuSolomoni: Mntanami, ngangizimisele ukwakhela ibizo leNkosi uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli indlu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:1–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Lan 17:1–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ilizwi leNkosi lafika kimi lisithi: Wena uchithe igazi elinengi, walwa izimpi ezinkulu; ngakho kawuyikwakhela ibizo lami indlu, ngoba uchithe igazi elinengi kangaka emhlabeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa, uzazala indodana ezakuba ngumuntu othanda ukuthula; ngizakuyiphumuza ezitheni zayo zonke inxa zonke. Izakuthiwa nguSolomoni okutsho umuntu othanda ukuthula, ngizamphumuza uIsrayeli ngimnike ukuthula ensukwini zakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena uzakwakhela ibizo lami indlu. Uzakuba yindodana yami, mina ngibe nguyise, ngiqinise ubukhosi bakhe koIsrayeli kuze kube nininini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena mntanami, iNkosi ibe lawe ukuze uphumelele ukwakha indlu yeNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho, njengokutsho kwayo ngawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi ikunike ukuhlakanipha lokuqedisisa, ukuba kuthi lapho ikunika amandla koIsrayeli, uwulondoloze umlayo weNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakuphumelelake uba unanzelela ukugcina izimiso lemithetho iNkosi uNkulunkulu eyayinika uIsrayeli ngoMose. Qina, ube lesibindi, ungesabi utshaywe luvalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.6+JOS.1.7+JOS.1.8+JOS.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 1:6–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngayo yonke imizamo yami ngilungisele indlu yeNkosi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " egolide ayizinkulungwane ezilikhulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " esiliva ayizinkulungwane eziyinkulungwane, lethusi lensimbi engelakulinganiswa, ngoba yinengi kakhulu; ngiyilungisele lezigodo lamatshe. Wenake uzakwengezelela kulokho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulezisebenzi ezinengi, ababazi bamatshe, labakha ngamatshe, lababazi bezigodo, lazo zonke inhlobo zezingcitshi ezingelakubalwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ezikwaziyo ukusebenza ngegolide lesiliva lethusi lensimbi. Qalisake ukusebenza; iNkosi ibe lawe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida waselaya zonke izinduna zakoIsrayeli ukumsiza uSolomoni indodana yakhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wathi: INkosi uNkulunkulu wenu kayilani na? Kayilinikanga ukuthula inxa zonke na? Ngoba inikele abantu belizwe esandleni sami, lelizwe linqotshelwe iNkosi labantu bayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vusani ingqondo zenu lenhliziyo zenu ukudinga iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu. Qalisani ukwakha indlu yeNkosi uNkulunkulu, ukuze umtshokotsho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " seNkosi lezitsha zikaNkulunkulu ezingcwele zingeniswe endlini eyakhelwe ibizo layo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
